<title>USA: Bear Stearns names Mexico banking head.</title>
<headline>Bear Stearns names Mexico banking head.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns Cos Inc said it named Alexandre Hayek as a managing director in international investment banking.</p>
<p>The firm said Hayek will head its business origination efforts in Mexico. Hayek will be based in New York.</p>
<p>Bear Stearns says Hayek served previously as a managing director at Banque Indosuez Belgique SA, where he directed the firm's emerging markets effort in New York.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1610))</p>
